"Cyril is Lute's legal father, a whiff whose parents are C-ranks."
"He divorced Jessica Velra when Lute was six, and lived in a family neighborhood."
"Once Lute was selected, Cyril being his real father became very unlikely."
"He wanted Lute's shortness treated."
"He never had a job, calls Lute Lutey, and saw him every other weekend."
"After Lute's selection he asked for time, and after 18 months hasn't decided to be his father."
"His own parents basically disowned him, and he moved out of the apartment Jessica provided."
"In the Matadero flood he drank at Stormy's, a whiff speakeasy, then stormed off toward a beach."
"He belted himself to a bridge railing in the flood, nearly hypothermic, until Lute rescued him."
